{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17545","headline":"和权载之离合诗 · 杨於陵","name":"和权载之离合诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"校德尽珪璋，才臣时所扬。\n放情寄文律，方茂经邦术。\n王猷符发挥，十载契心期。\n昼游有嘉话，书法无隐辞。\n信兹酧和美，言与芝兰比。\n昨来恣吟绎，日觉祛蒙鄙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨於陵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17545.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17545","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}